cli/commit/bc830b105867ae4234ddd7dd23f3f7680a2cbe3c\"><tt>bc830b1</tt></a> fix(scaffold): bump @civitai/* pins, and repair the disallowed-pool path they break (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5316880937\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/issues/515\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/civitai/cli/pull/515/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/pull/515\">#515</a>)</li>\n<li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/commit/e118ea10eb4e2c1b32d1cd15d5545348f2786721/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/commit/e118ea10eb4e2c1b32d1cd15d5545348f2786721\"><tt>e118ea1</tt></a> fix(scaffold): repair 27 dead CSS design tokens in page-money, and guard the class (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5316438831\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/issues/514\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/civitai/cli/pull/514/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/pull/514\">#514</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# npm (Node) — downloads + sha256-verifies the matching binary on install\nnpm install -g @civitai/cli        # or: npx @civitai/cli\n# Homebrew (macOS / Linux)\nbrew install civitai/tap/civitai\n# Go (from source)\ngo install github.com/civitai/cli/cmd/civitai@latest\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> npm (Node) — downloads + sha256-verifies the matching binary on install</span>\nnpm install -g @civitai/cli        <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: npx @civitai/cli</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Homebrew (macOS / Linux)</span>\nbr