      "notes_html": "<h2>Changelog</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/commit/c3af4cad891091183836f94a920895c1c28e1cd6/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/commit/c3af4cad891091183836f94a920895c1c28e1cd6\"><tt>c3af4ca</tt></a> fix(whoami): <code>canSubmitApps</code> was a false negative stated as fact, and the two surfaces disagreed (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5252436997\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/issues/492\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/civitai/cli/pull/492/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/pull/492\">#492</a>)</li>\n<li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/commit/547f6b59ad541bbf2998ccd5c4fbc3a05c0870f7/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/commit/547f6b59ad541bbf2998ccd5c4fbc3a05c0870f7\"><tt>547f6b5</tt></a> refactor(whoami): the credential TYPE is not a capability — split the section in two (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5252875998\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/issues/494\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/civitai/cli/pull/494/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/civitai/cli/pull/494\">#494</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# npm (Node) — downloads + sha256-verifies the matching binary on install\nnpm install -g @civitai/cli        # or: npx @civitai/cli\n# Homebrew (macOS / Linux)\nbrew install civitai/tap/civitai\n# Go (from source)\ngo install github.com/civitai/cli/cmd/civitai@latest\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> npm (Node) — downloads + sha256-verifies the matching binary on install</span>\nnpm install -g @civitai/cli        <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: npx @civitai/cli</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Homebrew (macOS / Linux)</span>\nbrew install civitai/tap/civitai\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Go (from source)</span>\ngo install github.com/civitai/cli/cmd/civitai@latest</pre></div>\n<p>Or grab a prebuilt binary from the assets below and verify it against <code>checksums.txt</code>.</p>",
